<title>INDIA: India approves $700 mln Coca Cola investment - PTI.</title>
<headline>India approves $700 mln Coca Cola investment - PTI.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian government's cabinet committee on foreign investment (CCFI) has approved a proposal by U.S. soft drink firm Coca Cola Company to invest $700 million, the Press Trust of India (PTI) said on Saturday.</p>
<p>Coca Cola's plan to set up two subsidiaries was among six foreign investment proposals approved by the committee on Friday, the news agency said.</p>
</text>
